 # ecocash-python
 
 [![CI](https://github.com/Interesting-Minds/Ecocash-multitenant/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Interesting-Minds/Ecocash-multitenant/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
